WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.027 --> 00:00:01.049
- If I work with you,

00:00:01.049 --> 00:00:03.319
I do not want to hear
from you online, ever.

00:00:03.319 --> 00:00:04.303
- Ever!

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:07.275
("Return to You")

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:09.413
- Terry, I know that we
both sit next to each other,

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:11.359
but it's assigned seating,
I didn't choose that.

00:00:11.359 --> 00:00:12.295
So, when you come up to me and say,

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:13.961
"Hey, that barbecue looked fun,"

00:00:13.961 --> 00:00:15.628
that's not the way you score an invite.

00:00:15.628 --> 00:00:17.108
I'm starting to get bummed out, Terry.

00:00:17.108 --> 00:00:20.005
- Wanda, stop asking me to
play Trivia Crack with you.

00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:22.527
I don't play games on
Facebook, neither should you.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:25.146
- Mr. McShane, of course
I saw your friend request.

00:00:25.146 --> 00:00:26.813
But if I accept that,
that's the equivalent

00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:28.084
of me just barging into your home

00:00:28.084 --> 00:00:29.426
and just asking to get fired.

00:00:29.426 --> 00:00:30.262
And I can't do that

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:32.968
'cause I really need this job, like badly.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:36.631
- Someone named Donovan, I
just accepted your request.

00:00:36.631 --> 00:00:37.851
I don't know who you are.

00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:40.117
I'm gonna assume, based
on our mutual friends,

00:00:40.117 --> 00:00:41.012
we work together.

00:00:41.012 --> 00:00:41.749
Just be chill.

00:00:41.749 --> 00:00:43.516
- Jen, 'sup?

00:00:43.516 --> 00:00:45.199
I really liked your new profile picture.

00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:46.097
- Wait, cute Jen?

00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:47.113
- Yeah, from reception.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.619
- Damn, she hasn't
accepted my request yet.

00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:51.271
- Sucks to suck.

00:00:51.271 --> 00:00:53.695
- The rest of you, we see
each other enough as it is.

00:00:53.695 --> 00:00:55.774
- When I go home, I just
wanna see a curated life

00:00:55.774 --> 00:00:57.139
my friends are pretending to live,

00:00:57.139 --> 00:00:58.568
not your face again, Neil.

00:00:58.568 --> 00:01:00.240
- Which is why we're starting the hashtag

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.292
#DontTalkToMe.

00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:02.467
- If we have the same signature

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:03.599
at the bottom of our checks--

00:01:03.599 --> 00:01:05.823
- If our only real life social interaction

00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:08.005
is you asking if I saw Game of Thrones--

00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:09.479
- If I choose not to see you

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:11.402
on a day that begins with the letter "S"--

00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:12.110
- Hashtag--

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.833
- [Both] DontTalkToMe.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:14.827
- Thank you.

00:01:14.827 --> 00:01:15.786
See you Monday.

